假设下面的代码已经运行：

```python
def weird(s):
    if s:
        if len(s) > 1:
            yield s[1]
        for x in weird(s[1:]):
            yield x
        yield s[0]

t = weird([5, [6, 7], 8])

def even(s):
    def weirder(t, i):
        if i < len(s):
            t.append(s[i-1])
            t.append(s[i])
            weirder(t, i * 2)
        return t
    return weirder([], 1)
```

